{"seq":1,"slug":"wasi-system-interface","title":"WASI：WebAssembly 系统接口","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/webassembly-toolchains-platforms/beyond-web/wasi-system-interface","wordCount":1087,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"wasi-webassembly-系统接口\">WASI：WebAssembly 系统接口</h1><p>WASI（WebAssembly System Interface）是 Wasm 走出浏览器的关键——它定义了一组标准化的系统调用接口，让 Wasm 模块可以可移植地访问文件系统、网络、时钟等操作系统资源。如果说 Wasm 核心规范是&quot;计算的标准&quot;，WASI 就是&quot;I/O 的标准&quot;。到 2026 年，WASI 0.2 已在生产环境广泛使用，WASI 0.3 引入了原生异步（futures/streams），为高并发服务端场景铺平道路。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>WASI 是 Wasm 的&quot;POSIX&quot;——一组标准化的系统调用接口，按能力包（capability packages）组织。其安全模型是默认零权限、宿主显式授予，每个能力（文件系统/网络/时钟）需要运行时启动时明确注入。WASI 0.2 建立在 Component Model 之上，0.3 引入原生 async（futures/streams）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"wasi-的定位与演进\">WASI 的定位与演进</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph &quot;2019-2022: Preview 1&quot;&#10;        A[WASI 0.1&lt;br/&gt;POSIX-like 文件/时钟/随机]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph &quot;2024.01: Preview 2&quot;&#10;        B[WASI 0.2&lt;br/&gt;Component Model + 能力包]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph &quot;2025 Q4: Preview 3&quot;&#10;        C[WASI 0.3&lt;br/&gt;原生 async&lt;br/&gt;futures/streams]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph &quot;规划中: 1.0&quot;&#10;        D[Component Model 1.0&lt;br/&gt;正式标准化]&#10;    end&#10;    A --&gt; B&#10;    B --&gt; C&#10;    C --&gt; D\">graph TB\n    subgraph \"2019-2022: Preview 1\"\n        A[WASI 0.1&lt;br/&gt;POSIX-like 文件/时钟/随机]\n    end\n    subgraph \"2024.01: Preview 2\"\n        B[WASI 0.2&lt;br/&gt;Component Model + 能力包]\n    end\n    subgraph \"2025 Q4: Preview 3\"\n        C[WASI 0.3&lt;br/&gt;原生 async&lt;br/&gt;futures/streams]\n    end\n    subgraph \"规划中: 1.0\"\n        D[Component Model 1.0&lt;br/&gt;正式标准化]\n    end\n    A --&gt; B\n    B --&gt; C\n    C --&gt; D</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>版本</th>\n<th>发布时间</th>\n<th>核心变化</th>\n<th>运行时支持</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>WASI 0.1 (Preview 1)</td>\n<td>2019</td>\n<td>类 POSIX 接口，fd_read/fd_write</td>\n<td>Wasmtime 1+, Wasmer, WasmEdge</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>WASI 0.2 (Preview 2)</td>\n<td>2024.01</td>\n<td>Component Model, WIT 接口, 能力包</td>\n<td>Wasmtime 17+</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>WASI 0.3 (Preview 3)</td>\n<td>2025 Q4</td>\n<td>原生 async (futures/streams)</td>\n<td>Wasmtime 28+</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>WASI 0.2.11</td>\n<td>2026.04</td>\n<td>补丁更新，HTTP/Sockets 稳定化</td>\n<td>Wasmtime 30+</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"能力安全模型\">能力安全模型</h2><p>WASI 的安全哲学是<strong>默认无权限，显式授予</strong>——运行时启动时不授予任何系统能力，每项资源访问都需要宿主显式声明：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# Wasmtime 运行时：显式授权&#10;wasmtime run \\&#10;  --dir /data::./data \\        # 仅映射 /data 目录（只读）&#10;  --env API_KEY=xxx \\          # 传入环境变量&#10;  --wasi http \\                # 授予 HTTP 客户端能力&#10;  app.wasm\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Wasmtime 运行时：显式授权</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">wasmtime</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> run</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --dir</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /data::./data</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\ </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">       # 仅映射 /data 目录（只读）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  --env</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> API_KEY=xxx</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\ </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">         # 传入环境变量</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  --wasi</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> http</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\ </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">               # 授予 HTTP 客户端能力</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  app.wasm</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这与容器的安全模型形成鲜明对比：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>容器 (Linux)</th>\n<th>WASI</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>默认权限</td>\n<td>进程拥有大量环境权限，通过策略收紧</td>\n<td>默认零权限，逐项授予</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>文件系统</td>\n<td>完整 rootfs，需 seccomp/AppArmor 限制</td>\n<td>仅映射的目录可见</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>网络</td>\n<td>默认可访问所有网络</td>\n<td>需显式授予 socket/HTTP 能力</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>进程</td>\n<td>可 fork/exec</td>\n<td>不存在进程概念</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>爆炸半径</td>\n<td>容器逃逸是已知攻击面</td>\n<td>沙箱由 Wasm 虚拟机硬保证</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"能力包-capability-packages\">能力包（Capability Packages）</h3><p>WASI 0.2 将系统能力组织为模块化的接口包：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>包</th>\n<th>接口</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>wasi:filesystem</code></td>\n<td>read, write, stat, openat</td>\n<td>文件系统访问</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>wasi:sockets</code></td>\n<td>TCP, UDP, DNS</td>\n<td>网络通信</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>wasi:http</code></td>\n<td>incoming-handler, outgoing-handler</td>\n<td>HTTP 服务</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>wasi:clocks</code></td>\n<td>monotonic-clock, wall-clock</td>\n<td>时间获取</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>wasi:random</code></td>\n<td>random, insecure-random</td>\n<td>随机数生成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>wasi:cli</code></td>\n<td>environment, stdin/stdout/stderr</td>\n<td>CLI 程序入口</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>wasi:keyvalue</code></td>\n<td>统一 KV 存储抽象</td>\n<td>Redis/DynamoDB/etcd</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>wasi:blobstore</code></td>\n<td>S3 兼容对象存储</td>\n<td>文件上传下载</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>开发者在 WIT 文件中声明所需能力，运行时据此注入：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"wit\" data-code=\"package myapp:service;&#10;&#10;world my-service {&#10;  import wasi:http/outgoing-handler@0.2.0;&#10;  import wasi:keyvalue/store@0.2.0;&#10;  export wasi:http/incoming-handler@0.2.0;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>package myapp:service;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>world my-service {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  import wasi:http/outgoing-handler@0.2.0;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  import wasi:keyvalue/store@0.2.0;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  export wasi:http/incoming-handler@0.2.0;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"运行时生态\">运行时生态</h2><h3 id=\"wasmtime-参考实现\">Wasmtime：参考实现</h3><p>Wasmtime 是 Bytecode Alliance 维护的参考运行时，2026 年已到 v30+：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 安装&#10;curl https://wasmtime.dev/install.sh -sSf | bash&#10;&#10;# 运行 CLI 程序&#10;wasmtime run app.wasm&#10;&#10;# 运行 HTTP 服务（WASI HTTP）&#10;wasmtime serve app.wasm --addr 0.0.0.0:8080\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 安装</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">curl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> https://wasmtime.dev/install.sh</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -sSf</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> bash</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 运行 CLI 程序</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">wasmtime</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> run</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> app.wasm</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 运行 HTTP 服务（WASI HTTP）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">wasmtime</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> serve</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> app.wasm</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --addr</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 0.0.0.0:8080</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"运行时对比\">运行时对比</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>运行时</th>\n<th>维护方</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Wasmtime</td>\n<td>Bytecode Alliance</td>\n<td>参考实现，最全的标准支持</td>\n<td>通用服务端</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Wasmer</td>\n<td>Wasmer Inc.</td>\n<td>多后端（Cranelift/LLVM/Singlepass）</td>\n<td>插件系统</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>WasmEdge</td>\n<td>CNCF</td>\n<td>2MB 体积，AI 推理支持</td>\n<td>IoT/边缘</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>wazero</td>\n<td>Go 社区</td>\n<td>纯 Go 实现，零 CGO</td>\n<td>Go 项目嵌入</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"wasi-0-3-原生异步\">WASI 0.3：原生异步</h2><p>WASI 0.3 引入的 async 支持是服务端 Wasm 的重大里程碑。在此之前，Wasm 函数是同步的——一个 HTTP 处理函数如果需要等待数据库响应，整个线程就被阻塞。</p>\n<p>WASI 0.3 通过 Component Model 的 <code>future</code> 和 <code>stream</code> 类型实现非阻塞 I/O：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"wit\" data-code=\"// WIT 接口定义&#10;interface async-example {&#10;  // 返回一个 future，不阻塞调用者&#10;  fetch-data: func(url: string) -&gt; future&lt;list&lt;u8&gt;&gt;;&#10;&#10;  // 返回一个流，支持增量消费&#10;  stream-events: func() -&gt; stream&lt;event&gt;;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// WIT 接口定义</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>interface async-example {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  // 返回一个 future，不阻塞调用者</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  fetch-data: func(url: string) -> future&#x3C;list&#x3C;u8>>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  // 返回一个流，支持增量消费</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  stream-events: func() -> stream&#x3C;event>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这使得单个 Wasm 实例可以并发处理数千个请求——类似 Node.js 的事件循环模型，但由运行时（而非语言）提供调度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"实战-构建-wasi-服务\">实战：构建 WASI 服务</h2><h3 id=\"rust-cargo-component\">Rust + cargo-component</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"cargo install cargo-component&#10;cargo component new my-service --reactor\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">cargo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> cargo-component</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">cargo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> component</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> my-service</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --reactor</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"// src/lib.rs&#10;wit_bindgen::generate!({&#10;    world: &quot;my-service&quot;,&#10;    exports: {&#10;        &quot;wasi:http/incoming-handler&quot;: MyHandler,&#10;    },&#10;});&#10;&#10;struct MyHandler;&#10;&#10;impl exports::wasi::http::incoming_handler::Guest for MyHandler {&#10;    fn handle(request: IncomingRequest, response_out: ResponseOutparam) {&#10;        let headers = Fields::new();&#10;        let response = OutgoingResponse::new(headers);&#10;        response.set_status_code(200).unwrap();&#10;&#10;        let body = response.body().unwrap();&#10;        body.write().unwrap().blocking_write_and_flush(b&quot;Hello from WASI!&quot;).unwrap();&#10;&#10;        ResponseOutparam::set(response_out, Ok(response));&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// src/lib.rs</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>wit_bindgen::generate!({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    world: \"my-service\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    exports: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        \"wasi:http/incoming-handler\": MyHandler,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>struct MyHandler;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>impl exports::wasi::http::incoming_handler::Guest for MyHandler {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fn handle(request: IncomingRequest, response_out: ResponseOutparam) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        let headers = Fields::new();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        let response = OutgoingResponse::new(headers);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        response.set_status_code(200).unwrap();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        let body = response.body().unwrap();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        body.write().unwrap().blocking_write_and_flush(b\"Hello from WASI!\").unwrap();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ResponseOutparam::set(response_out, Ok(response));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"cargo component build --release&#10;wasmtime serve target/wasm32-wasip2/release/my_service.wasm\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">cargo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> component</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> build</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --release</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">wasmtime</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> serve</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> target/wasm32-wasip2/release/my_service.wasm</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"与容器的共存\">与容器的共存</h2><p>WASI 不是容器的替代品，而是补充。判断何时用 WASI：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>容器</th>\n<th>WASI</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>完整操作系统环境</td>\n<td>适合</td>\n<td>不适合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>亚毫秒冷启动</td>\n<td>不适合（秒级）</td>\n<td>适合（&lt; 1ms）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>高密度部署（万实例）</td>\n<td>内存开销大</td>\n<td>极低内存</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多语言插件系统</td>\n<td>复杂</td>\n<td>天然支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>已有容器化服务</td>\n<td>继续用</td>\n<td>逐步迁移热路径</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>边缘/IoT</td>\n<td>资源受限</td>\n<td>2MB 运行时</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>WASI 是 Wasm 的系统调用标准，让模块可移植地访问文件/网络/时钟等资源</li>\n<li>能力安全模型：默认零权限，宿主显式授予，爆炸半径极小</li>\n<li>WASI 0.2 引入 Component Model 和能力包，WASI 0.3 引入原生 async</li>\n<li>Wasmtime 是参考实现，WasmEdge 适合 IoT，Wasmer 适合插件系统</li>\n<li>WASI 与容器互补：冷启动敏感、高密度、插件场景优先考虑 WASI</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"component-model-and-wit\">Component Model 与 WIT</a>：跨语言组件组合的机制详解</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../frontend-web-workers-parallelism/practice/worker-debugging\">Worker 调试技巧</a>：类比 WASI 服务端的调试思路</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"WASI：WebAssembly 系统接口","id":"wasi-webassembly-系统接口"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"WASI 的定位与演进","id":"wasi-的定位与演进"},{"level":2,"text":"能力安全模型","id":"能力安全模型"},{"level":3,"text":"能力包（Capability Packages）","id":"能力包-capability-packages"},{"level":2,"text":"运行时生态","id":"运行时生态"},{"level":3,"text":"Wasmtime：参考实现","id":"wasmtime-参考实现"},{"level":3,"text":"运行时对比","id":"运行时对比"},{"level":2,"text":"WASI 0.3：原生异步","id":"wasi-0-3-原生异步"},{"level":2,"text":"实战：构建 WASI 服务","id":"实战-构建-wasi-服务"},{"level":3,"text":"Rust + cargo-component","id":"rust-cargo-component"},{"level":2,"text":"与容器的共存","id":"与容器的共存"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"浏览器生产案例与框架集成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/webassembly-toolchains-platforms/web-integration/browser-use-cases"},"next":{"title":"Component Model 与 WIT 接口","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/webassembly-toolchains-platforms/beyond-web/component-model-and-wit"}}